WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.092 --> 00:01:16.957
song The pals see a boy.

2
00:01:18.618 --> 00:01:19.919
His name is Roy.

3
00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:23.301
Roy sees a game.

4
00:01:23.321 --> 00:01:26.303
Roy: I want a toy.

5
00:01:29.705 --> 00:01:31.506
But I have no coins.

6
00:01:32.827 --> 00:01:39.312
Pink: That game looks fun.

7
00:01:47.912 --> 00:01:49.373
Green points to a coil.

8
00:01:52.954 --> 00:01:54.194
Pink puts in a coin.

9
00:01:58.355 --> 00:01:59.616
He grabs the coil.

10
00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:05.597
Green: Yay!

11
00:02:11.999 --> 00:02:13.600
Blue points to a toy pig.

12
00:02:18.968 --> 00:02:20.349
Pink grabs the toy.

13
00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:26.050
Blue: Yay!

14
00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:30.332
Red: Oink!

15
00:02:30.812 --> 00:02:37.714
Oink! Pink puts in lots of coins.

16
00:02:40.255 --> 00:02:41.796
He grabs lots of toys.

17
00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:53.914
Pink has one coin left.

18
00:02:58.197 --> 00:02:59.578
He grabs a toy truck.

19
00:03:06.844 --> 00:03:08.806
Let's give it to Roy!

20
00:03:19.355 --> 00:03:20.776
Roy jumps for joy.
